      <h1>Name Numerology Basics: What Your Name Number Can and Cannot Tell You</h1>
      <p>Learn a simple name numerology method, what name numbers symbolize and how to read the result without overclaiming.</p>
    </section>
    <article class="prose article-body">
      <div class="note-box"><strong>Important disclaimer:</strong> This guide is for entertainment, journaling and self-reflection only. It is not medical, legal, financial, psychological or life-decision advice.</div>
      
<p class="lead">Name numerology turns letters into numbers and reduces them into a symbolic theme. It is popular because names feel personal, but a name number should be read lightly. It can suggest a style of expression, not determine your identity.</p>
<h2>A simple letter-to-number method</h2>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Number</th><th>Letters</th><th>Theme</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>A J S</td><td>Leadership</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>B K T</td><td>Cooperation</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>C L U</td><td>Expression</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>D M V</td><td>Structure</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>E N W</td><td>Freedom</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>F O X</td><td>Care</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>G P Y</td><td>Depth</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>H Q Z</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>I R</td><td>Compassion</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h2>Example calculation</h2><p>The name “Maya” becomes M=4, A=1, Y=7, A=1. Total = 13, then 1 + 3 = 4. A 4 name theme may feel practical, steady and organized.</p>
<h2>How to interpret the result</h2><p>Ask where the theme appears in your communication. A 3 may express through humor, design or storytelling. A 8 may express through confidence, responsibility or ambition. The result is more useful when connected to behavior.</p><div class="ad-slot">Advertisement space after AdSense approval</div>
<h2>What name numerology cannot do</h2><p>It cannot judge a person’s value, guarantee success or decide whether a name is “good” or “bad.” If a result creates fear, step back. The healthiest reading is one that gives language, not pressure.</p>

